OL,3,AShopkeeper immortalised by royal
OL,4,Aportrait artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA corner shop owner from south London
OL,7,Fhas been painted by a royal portraitist
OL,8,Fin a project to recognise the impact of
OL,9,Findependent businesses in their local
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,FArtist Nick Bashall, who painted
OL,13,FPrincess Anne, has depicted Kaual
OL,14,FPatel, owner of Torridon Convenience
OL,15,FStore in Catford.
OL,17,FThe work will be revealed to the public
OL,18,Fin a new exhibition, Local Royalty,
OL,19,Falongside paintings by other royal
OL,20,Fartists of pub, cafe and takeaway
OL,21,Fowners.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
